r of the College of Audiologists and Speech Language Pathologists of Ontario","value":"A member of the College of Audiologists and Speech Language Pathologists of Ontario."},{"label":"A member of the College of Chiropractors of Ontario","value":"A member of the College of Chiropractors of Ontario."},{"label":"A member of the College of Nurses of Ontario","value":"A member of the College of Nurses of Ontario."},{"label":"A member of the College of Occupational Therapists of Ontario","value":"A member of the College of Occupational Therapists of Ontario."},{"label":"A member of the College of Optometrists of Ontario","value":"A member of the College of Optometrists of Ontario."},{"label":"A member of the College of Physicians and Surgeons of Ontario","value":"A member of the College of Physicians and Surgeons of Ontario."},{"label":"A member of the College of Physiotherapists of Ontario","value":"A member of the College of Physiotherapists of Ontario."},{"label":"A member of the College of Psychologists of Ontario","value":"A member of the College of Psychologists of Ontario."},{"label":"A member of the College of Registered Psychotherapists and Registered Mental Health Therapists of Ontario","value":"A member of the College of Registered Psychotherapists and Registered Mental Health Therapists of Ontario"}],"textType":null,"allowMediaUploads":null,"order":"q","riderInterfaceVisibility":"edit","driverInterfaceVisibility":"hidden","isSearchable":false,"isAvailableToRiderInterface":true,"isAvailableToDriverInterface":false,"createdAt":1734022666,"updatedAt":1734099894},{"id":"1d14ac3d-d46b-473a-99ac-61c6b138dde0","fieldGroupId":"06e95a65-eff7-4406-b0b1-eb327c6a9b3f","status":"active","key":"pleaseUploadACopyOrPhotoOfYourDocumentation","label":"Please upload a copy or photo of your documentation *","type":"file","isRequired":true,"hint":null,"choices":null,"textType":null,"allowMediaUploads":null,"order":"r","riderInterfaceVisibility":"edit","driverInterfaceVisibility":"hidden","isSearchable":false,"isAvailableToRiderInterface":true,"isAvailableToDriverInterface":false,"createdAt":1734022691,"updatedAt":1734099526},{"id":"ee31bbf6-879d-4d72-864b-a5912f7dec05","fieldGroupId":"06e95a65-eff7-4406-b0b1-eb327c6a9b3f","status":"active","key":"signatureUseYourFingerStylusOrMouseToSignInTheBox","label":"Signature. Use your finger, stylus or mouse to sign in the box. *","type":"drawing","isRequired":true,"hint":null,"choices":null,"textType":null,"allowMediaUploads":null,"order":"s","riderInterfaceVisibility":"edit","driverInterfaceVisibility":"hidden","isSearchable":false,"isAvailableToRiderInterface":true,"isAvailableToDriverInterface":false,"createdAt":1734022721,"updatedAt":1734099530}],"formContents":[{"id":"6a7a63d0-0c51-4b81-84de-9ee00ea082ff","name":"","formId":"7d3530cc-ddc6-4ac8-a89c-bbff7ac3648e","stage":"default","status":"active","order":"b","type":"default","riderInterfaceVisibility":"view","content":"**Please note that this application is optional**\n\nService animals that accompany passengers with disabilities, such as guide dogs, are welcome at all public areas of the Grand River Transit (GRT) system.\n\nIf you have a service animal, and the animal does not wear a noticeable vest or harness saying that it is a service animal, the GRT operator (or Transit Security on ION trains) may ask you to show identification that the animal is needed for reasons of a disability. Under the Accessibility for Ontarians with Disabilities Act, businesses and organizations can ask for documentation from a regulated health professional stating that you need your animal because of a disability.\n\n**Using a Service Animal EasyGO Card instead of producing documentation**\nIf you would prefer to tap a Service Animal EasyGO Card, rather than show documentation from an acceptable regulated health professional stating that you need your animal because of a disability, please complete and submit this application.\n\nIf your application is approved, you will be able to obtain a Service Animal EasyGO Card. Tapping this card when boarding GRT buses or ION trains will indicate to the GRT operator (or Transit Security on ION trains) that they do not need to ask to see your service animal documentation.\n\n**About this application**\n\nPlease complete all fields of the application. Incomplete applications will not be processed and will be returned to you.\n\n**Personal Information and Privacy**\n\nAll personal information collected on this application and any supporting documentation is collected under the authority of the Municipal Act, 2001, and in accordance with the Municipal Freedom of Information and Protection of Privacy Act, and is used solely for the purpose of determining eligibility for the Service Animal EasyGO Card. The application and supporting documentation will be discussed only with the applicant or the applicant's representative. If a Release of Information Consent is completed, the application may be discussed with the individual named in the release.\n\nAny questions about this collection should be directed to: Manager, Marketing, Communications and Customer Service, 250 Strasburg Rd. Kitchener ON 519-585-7555 TTY: 519-575-4608","conditions":[],"createdAt":1734020456,"updatedAt":1734098795},{"id":"bba68228-9462-4f1b-bd9c-c9e4333f4bec","name":"","formId":"7d3530cc-ddc6-4ac8-a89c-bbff7ac3648e","stage":"postSubmit","status":"active","order":"b","type":"default","riderInterfaceVisibility":"view","content":"### Thank you\n\nYour application has been submitted.\n\nIf you entered an email address, you will receive a confirmation email.\n\nQuestions? Contact us at 519-585-7555 / Deaf and Hard of Hearing (TTY): 519-585-4806","conditions":[],"createdAt":1734022770,"updatedAt":1734022770},{"id":"9f711329-627b-4a38-9b07-b02a81c3ee3f","name":"","formId":"7d3530cc-ddc6-4ac8-a89c-bbff7ac3648e","stage":"default","status":"active","order":"c","type":"default","riderInterfaceVisibility":"view","content":"**Applicant details**\n\nRequired fields are marked with asterisks (*)\nThis section of the application must be filled out by the applicant (or a representative, see below).","conditions":[],"createdAt":1734020503,"updatedAt":1734020503},{"id":"0c86aae2-c480-4ce8-a4f6-dcd59373c7b1","name":"","formId":"7d3530cc-ddc6-4ac8-a89c-bbff7ac3648e","stage":"default","status":"active","order":"p","type":"default","riderInterfaceVisibility":"view","content":"### Service animal documentation\n\nRequired fields are marked with asterisks (*)\nPeople with service animals may produce documentation from any of the following regulated health professionals stating that you need your animal because of a disability. Please check the acceptable regulated health professional that has provided this documentation to you for your service animal and **attach a copy of this documentation.**","conditions":[],"createdAt":1734022507,"updatedAt":1734022507}],"organizationTerms":{"termsOfUseUrl":"https://sparelabs.com/terms-of-use/","privacyPolicyUrl":"https://sparelabs.com/privacy-policy/","serviceTermsUrl":null},"submitted":false}
