- [NEW] **SSO set ⊃ org-key set**: `translink.ca` → workos 200 (SSO tenant) while org-key `translink` → 404. `regionofwaterloo.ca` → 404 (GRT has no SSO binding). Confirms a class of SSO-only tenants invisible to the org-key oracle.

